  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Abilities of Vulnerable Ethnic Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports maternal and child health through Sexual and Reproductive Health Rights (SRHR) education, menstrual hygiene, and nutrition kits for 260 lactating mothers. It also empowers 50 vulnerable families with vocational skills and market access in agriculture, livestock, and handicrafts. By linking health and livelihoods, it aims to reduce poverty and build resilience in Ta-Oy District.</narrative>
  </description>
